{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_almond_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_almond_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Long-Haul",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_almond_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "21947f201ddab390c38c98868cd97343ff8ae0866bf9fb0e48095c4ec840967f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Laura? Fort Barron's nothing new to you, is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh... Sorry, I was just thinking about something..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I saw you staring at the model on the desk. You almost had me thinking maybe there was something wrong with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I heard from the senior operators that the engineering team made this model as a memento, after Fort Barron's retrofit was completed and delivered."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, there's nothing wrong with it, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's fine. It looks... just like the base does now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good to hear. Shall we continue, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm ready. Let me take a look at your report... Ahem..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Laura, what did you do after you received the order to catch the bank robbers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At the time, I was leading the engineering team to double-check the structural integrity of the plate connection, and after we got the news..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I chose to continue the work we were already doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could you go into the reasoning behind your decision?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The orders I received were that, aside from those participating directly in the plate's connection work, all other teams were to start pursuing the bank robbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I made the determination that the connection work still needed the manpower of our engineering team."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So I chose to follow orders and not divert anyone from our work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But according to the report, one of the bank robbers was your partner at Davistown. Were you aware of that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I knew about that, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Regarding that, what was your determination at the time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Determination... My determination?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Don't make me repeat myself.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My determination... I didn't make any..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm an employee of Blacksteel, and following my orders..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...is my responsibility."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Frowns) ......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Following orders. Laura, you made the right decision.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How's that? I do a pretty good impression, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And that 'Don't make me repeat myself' was, like, exactly the same, wasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh* What's wrong, Laura? You look so out of it. It can't be because I'm putting too much pressure on you, can it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's okay... I'm just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please, let's just get back to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um... That was the last question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I need to tell you this, Laura. Ever since we got back from Davistown, you've looked kind of uneasy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We all know that it was a very special operation, and you happened to be at the heart of the vortex."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I really can't imagine what you went through, but even then, you can't let yourself be tied up by something like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What you need now is rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rest..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And some very good rest. So stop thinking about the mission report. You should apply for leave instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right... I can't stay so depressed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So Aliza, can we do this again, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You haven't been listening at all, have you...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you ask me, you'd best forget about the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's been two weeks. No one's ever going to bring it up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In the long history of the company, this was only a tiny interlude. You can be as serious about this as you want, but the supervisor's only going to pretend to be interested."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's right. You should be asking them for a long vacation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No... I have to finish this report."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was in Davistown from the start. I saw most of what happened with my own eyes. I experienced most of it personally."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's a Blacksteel employee's responsibility to execute their orders during a mission, and to compile a report on it afterwards. Besides..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You saw what I wrote, didn't you? Don't you think the higher-ups should be informed of everything that happened in an organized report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Laura, I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Frankly, there's no need to report anything. What happened in Davistown couldn't be any clearer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "While completing a government-sanctioned mission, a Blacksteel employee participated in criminal activities and greatly damaged our company's image and reputation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone here already knows all that. It isn't something worth bringing up over and over again. Especially not... two weeks after the fact."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need paychecks to put food on the table. We need to follow orders and not get fired."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Mercenary",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So there's no reason for you to work yourself up over this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... I still think I want to talk to somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nothing wrong with that. That's how you learn discipline."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you going to do it again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds like you still don't realize what I'm punishing you for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Follow me once you're done eating."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's the matter, Laura? You asked to talk to me all of a sudden."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Um, Franka, there's something I want your opinion on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is it about Davistown?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is it that obvious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our little pistachio who's always cheering everyone up is suddenly acting all sulky. It'd be harder <i>not</i> to figure it out, don't you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I put together a report on Davistown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Liskarm already submitted one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Like, a good while ago?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know, but—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, I can more or less guess what you wrote in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I can tell you what's going to happen if you submit it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It'll be ignored, your issues won't be addressed, and if whoever has to read it is in a bad mood that day, you may even be disciplined."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's that simple."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's been two weeks, but sometimes I still think about what happened back there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All of us saw what was going on in Davistown. Jessica did so much for them, but even that wasn't enough for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hasn't she always been like that though?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Franka... Do you think I did poorly in Davistown?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wow, who knew pistachios were so rich in vitamin justice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This isn't about justice—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least you two got to see her in the end. What was I doing while all that was going on...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She was in such a dangerous situation, but I was just hanging out on the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even though... Even though I really wanted to be with her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'We're wearing Blacksteel uniforms and following the orders of the higher-ups. It's not your fault if you weren't able to do something.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If our good captain Liskarm were here, I'm sure she'd say that in the sincerest, most heartfelt way you ever heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then, she'd probably give you a warm hug and make sure you knew you had someone to lean on aboard the landship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Franka, are you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All I'm saying is that if you turn around and go run into Liskarm's arms right about now, you'll get all the well-meaning advice and comfort you could ever want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But me? All you're gonna get from me is my sharp tongue and some finely aged sarcasm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I think that's what I want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright then. Do you feel bad because you weren't able to help Jessica, or are you just jealous that she made a choice when you couldn't?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you write that report because you believe it's the truth, or are you just trying to convince yourself that you're not a coward?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was born to a normal family. My mother is an ordinary doctor, but I didn't have a lot of freedom."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My family moved from Bolívar to Columbia when I was younger. I managed to get into college, but then I caught Oripathy right before I graduated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "None of the tech companies I was aiming for would give me a second glance. Blacksteel was the only place I could go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And when I got here, the first thing I learned was to follow orders and do whatever the rest of the team does."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not jealous that she made a choice..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The name Brynley gave Jessica more trouble than it ever helped. We could all see that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So I'm not jealous of her wealth either. I know she carries a much bigger burden than I do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But that's exactly why I don't get it. How come Jessica was able to make that choice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A silence falls between the two of them.\nAfter some time, the brown-haired Vulpo looks up at the nightfall and breathes a sigh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, if you'd gone after Jessica with us after you got that order, would you have pointed your gun at her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wouldn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if you were ordered to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I still wouldn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Because—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't want to hurt her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, don't you think you've already made a choice too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, how's that—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How is it <i>not</i>?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "None of us are from a big, famous family like hers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "When someone important makes a decision, it affects a lot of people, but for grunts like us, it doesn't have to matter to anyone but ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that really enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why wouldn't it be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's take a step back. Admitting that you just don't want to be a coward... would honestly be more honest than the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But isn't it important to tell the truth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sometimes, what's more important to the truth is being remembered."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm just gonna throw this out there, so you just listen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know that place called Rhodes Island, where Liskarm and I are dispatched—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The missions there are tough, but they offer some pretty nice benefits, and the people there are all pretty kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If some little pistachio thinks there's no room in Blacksteel for her to grow..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then a change in soil isn't such a bad idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thanks, Franka."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone always says that you're the lady to talk to about this sort of thing. And they're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, hold up, <i>what</i> exactly are they saying about me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They all told me that Franka's got a foul mouth, but she'll help you solve your troubles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which numbskulls are out there ruining my street cred?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you really interested in that equipment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then why didn't you just ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right, I don't like it when you play with these parts, and I definitely don't want to see you end up like Grandma, holed up in the garage all day long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But you should've asked."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right, I could say no, but maybe I wouldn't have. There could be a different outcome, another choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But if you never try, you'll never have another choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You see that table? That's your workbench from now on. Take out everything you've been hiding under your bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you need me for something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sure you know that my last mission was in Davistown, right...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm aware. What's up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "About that, I wrote up a mission report as per protocol."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Since when did we have a protocol like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, we do..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mission report... Oh, now I remember. Yeah, I guess you're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That was a big mission, with plenty of twists and turns. Good work getting a report out of all that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, it’s nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So I trust this will fill in a lot of blanks about the incident."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man on the other side of the desk quickly reads through her report as she watches.\nThere's a sigh.\nThat's not what she expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This isn't what you should be writing reports on, Laura."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're in charge of technology. There shouldn't be anything in here unrelated to our engineering work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I understand that, but I saw so much more than that while carrying out my mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't pretend I didn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...…"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whatever. No one's going to read this anyway, so it'll do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He flips to the last page of the report and briskly signs his name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You still have a long career ahead of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You really need to learn to sort out what you've seen and what you haven't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, Chief, I'm just an engineer. I'm not too good at that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Which is why I have a request."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Engineering Supervisor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to apply for the next round of exchange projects and be dispatched to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*cough* Let's continue, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W-Wait. I'm not ready yet. Let me get myself together first..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay, okay. Let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm... So what's the story behind that puppet you carry on your waist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The puppet on my waist... What? Is that really an interview question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course it. It's right here in the <i>Big Book of Interview Questions</i> Franka gave me. 'Every now and then, interviewees should be asked questions about the accessories they're wearing.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright then... My mother made me this, and I've been carrying it around ever since. Is that good enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shorter than the expected answer length, but it shouldn't be a problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, you've already been through so many terrifying tests before this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Didn't Franka tell you? As long as you pass the tests, the interview's just a formality and an excuse to chat. The way I see it, there's nothing to prep for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, no no no. If I'm doing something, I've gotta do it <i>right</i>! I'm not taking any chances. Quick, next question!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ooh, this question seems pretty reliable..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Laura! Let's hang out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, are you studying for your Rhodes Island interview?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like you've made up your mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What'd you expect? Shh, we'll talk later. Let me finish this question first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blacksteel Clerk",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Laura, what are your thoughts on your future?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My future?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Laura",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My... future..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's too dangerous here, mija. We can't stay anymore. I don't want to see you grow up in a warzone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't want this either, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mother",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A lot of times, we don't get to decide our own fate. I... I don't have a choice."
